<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus t-bill yield at 5.67 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus t-bill yield at 5.67 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus central bank said the average yield of a reverse repo auction of eight-day treasury bills on Thursday was 5.67 percent, down 22 basis points from the average yield on five-day bills sold on October 18.</p>
<p>Commercial banks' bids totalled 14.5 million pounds for the eight million pounds worth of bills on offer.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom, 357 2 365089</p>
